# secagent

`secagent` is a DevSecOps security orchestration CLI that runs multiple scanners, normalizes findings, enforces policy, and emits unified reports.

This repository is being built incrementally with test-first checkpoints.

## Quick start

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .[dev]
secagent version
secagent validate-config --config secagent.yml.example
```
